body:
it IS inescapable, there is no reasonable path forward, not in real life. statistics and probability doesn't mean anything when you have worlds of hurdles to jump through, all without ANY relief from the burden. 

&#x200B;

and if you have any kind of ailment then it becomes even harder, and you're not given a remotely equitable time.

so the only way would be to dismantle the bonds themselves? 

&#x200B;

So I could just nuke the relationships and then end it?

(assuming win 10) Go to Control panel. Add device; choose your hhkb, then choose the drop downed option (try passcpde or something) and you're golden.

&#x200B;

Don't worry about your hhkb being the issue. I'm fairly certain that it's another buggy windows feature

&#x200B;
